        <activityName xml:lang="en">Recycling aggregate from concrete demolition, dry, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Recycling aggregate from concrete demolition, dry, at plant
This is a multi output process of concrete demolition entering the recycling plant. An economic allocation is applied between the disposal service of concrete demolition and the recycling product RC-C and recycled iron.;
UUID: 6810fde9-77b2-3530-8cfd-94f691afdd4b
Includes the infrastructure, energy demand and waste of the recycling process of concrete demolition
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: dry processing, stationary crusher
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: unknown 
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: &lt;null&gt;
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_6810fde9-77b2-3530-8cfd-94f691afdd4b.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
